  "help": "Outpost Capture: move Scouts one hex for 1 AP and 1 Fuel. Deploy at your empty base for 2 AP and 3 Fuel (maximum 3 Scouts). Stand on the opposing base and Claim for 1 AP to win. Start each turn with 3 AP and gain 2 Fuel, capped at 6. Draw after 30 full rounds. No combat or cargo.",
